 &lt;h1&gt;Yunseo Choi&lt;/h1&gt;
 &lt;div class="about-me content lead"&gt;
 My research goal is to develop &lt;strong&gt;computer vision&lt;/strong&gt; frameworks that can advance psychological research and affective computing by enabling &lt;strong&gt;automated recognition of human nonverbal cues&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;In particular, I am interested in:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Automated recognition of facial expressions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Body language analysis for behavioral studies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Computer vision applications in affective computing and psychology&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📧 Email:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href='mailto:dbstjys@yonsei.ac.kr'&gt;dbstjys@yonsei.ac.kr&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📞 Phone:&lt;/strong&gt; +82 10-3357-4519&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📝 Blog: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href='https://blog.naver.com/yafavvboba' target='_blank'&gt;blog.naver.com/yafavvboba&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;📄 CV:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href='https://adritian-demo.vercel.app/files/CV.pdf' target='_blank'&gt;Download PDF&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>